* getpid.a - standalone process-id call for the OS-9 backend.
* (The full lib/sys.a/id.a pulls in setuid/setgid and extra error codes that
*  cross-compiled programs here do not need; getpid only needs F$ID.)
* Returns the process id in D, per the c3 v2 ABI.  Matches lib/sys.a/id.a.
 psect getpid_a,0,0,0,0,0
getpid:
 pshs y                  preserve data pointer (ROM scratch)
 os9 F$ID                A = process id (no error possible)
 puls y
 tfr a,b
 clra
 rts
 endsect
